          <div class="cbt-card-meta">
            <span class="q-exam">NEET / JEE</span>
            <span class="cbt-marks-badge">180 Marks</span>
            <span class="q-year">⏱ 45 Mins</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Mini Mock (Fast Drill)</h3>
          <p>45 questions: 15 Physics, 15 Chemistry, 15 Biology. Perfect for daily testing and speed training.</p>
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="startCbtMock('mini-mock')">Start Mini Mock ➔</button>
        </div>

        <div class="cbt-card" style="border-top: 3px solid #00b4d8">
          <div class="cbt-card-meta">
            <span class="q-exam">Physics Focus</span>
            <span class="cbt-marks-badge">180 Marks</span>
            <span class="q-year">⏱ 45 Mins</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Physics Sectional Drill</h3>
          <p>45 high-yield MCQs sampled across all 28 chapters of Class 11 & 12 Physics + verified PYQs.</p>
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="startCbtMock('physics-drill')">Start Physics Drill ➔</button>
        </div>

        <div class="cbt-card" style="border-top: 3px solid #ba68c8">
          <div class="cbt-card-meta">
            <span class="q-exam">Chemistry Focus</span>
            <span class="cbt-marks-badge">180 Marks</span>
            <span class="q-year">⏱ 45 Mins</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Chemistry Sectional Drill</h3>
          <p>45 questions spanning Physical, Inorganic, and Organic Chemistry from Class 11 & 12 NCERT.</p>
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="startCbtMock('chem-drill')">Start Chemistry Drill ➔</button>
        </div>

        <div class="cbt-card" style="border-top: 3px solid #4caf50">
          <div class="cbt-card-meta">
            <span class="q-exam">Biology Focus</span>
            <span class="cbt-marks-badge">180 Marks</span>
            <span class="q-year">⏱ 45 Mins</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Biology Sectional Drill</h3>
          <p>45 questions divided into Botany and Zoology from Class 11 & 12 NCERT line-by-line.</p>
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="startCbtMock('bio-drill')">Start Biology Drill ➔</button>
        </div>

        <div class="cbt-card" style="border-top: 3px solid #fbc02d">
          <div class="cbt-card-meta">
            <span class="q-exam">Adaptive Revision</span>
            <span class="cbt-marks-badge">${mistakesCount} Logged</span>
            <span class="q-year">⏱ Targeted</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Mistakes Notebook Practice</h3>
          <p>Drill directly on the questions you previously got wrong. Overcome misconceptions and master weak concepts.</p>
          <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="startMistakesQuiz()" ${mistakesCount === 0 ? 'disabled style="opacity:0.5"' : ''}>
            ${mistakesCount > 0 ? `Practice ${mistakesCount} Mistakes ➔` : 'No Mistakes Yet'}
