            <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px"><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;background:#ffb703"></span> 🟡 Moderate (${pctMod}%)</span>
            <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px"><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;background:#e63946"></span> 🔴 Time Sink >90s (${pctSink}%)</span>
